></mxCell><mxCell id="n440" value="1. Pin map follows firmware config.example.h: MQ7 AO=34, MQ7 heater PWM=25, DS18B20=4, GPS RX/TX=16/17, SIM800L RX/TX=26/27," style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="709.0" width="774.8" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n441" value="    battery sense=35, LEDs Y/R/B=14/12/13, buzzer=32." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="729.0" width="334.6" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n442" value="2. UART crossover: ESP32 RX pin (IO16 / IO26) connects to the module TX; ESP32 TX pin (IO17 / IO27) connects to the module RX." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="749.0" width="787.2" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n443" value="3. GPS VCC on 3V3 (GY-GPS6MV2 accepts 3.3-5 V). DS18B20 needs the 4.7 kΩ pull-up to 3V3 on DQ." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="769.0" width="588.8" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n444" value="4. MQ-7 high-side driver (Q1/Q2/R4/R5) is a reference design: the firmware only says BJT/MOSFET. Heater Vc is the PWM output, not the 5 V rail." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="789.0" width="892.6" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n445" value="5. SIM800L chip wants 3.4-4.4 V and ~2 A bursts (firmware guide: dedicated 4.0 V rail). The EVB board is drawn on +5V; confirm its input range." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="809.0" width="892.6" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n446" value="6. DC-in sense is drawn on the adapter output; the firmware does not say which rail the divider reads. Confirm." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="829.0" width="694.2" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n447" value="7. Mains path: J1 → HW-370 charger → 2S BMS → 2×18650. PACK+ (6–8.4 V) feeds only the LM2596 buck; never the 5 V pins." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30.0" y="849.0" width="737.6" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n448" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#8b1a1a;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="680" width="770" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n449" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#8b1a1a;strokeWidth=1.6;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1110.0" y="740.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1880.0" y="740.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n450" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#8b1a1a;strokeWidth=1.6;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1110.0" y="800.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1880.0" y="800.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n451" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#8b1a1a;strokeWidth=1.6;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1500.0" y="800.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1500.0" y="920.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n452" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#8b1a1a;strokeWidth=1.6;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1700.0" y="800.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1700.0" y="920.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n453" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#8b1a1a;strokeWidth=1.6;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1500.0" y="860.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1880.0" y="860.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n454" value="TITLE:  IoT Fire Detection Node (AgapSense)  ESP32" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=15;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1125.0" y="708.5" width="471.0" height="23" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n455" value="Design after the SparkFun RedBoard-style sheet layout" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1125.0" y="757.0" width="334.6" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n456" value="Pin assignments from firmware/agapsense-firmware/src/config.example.h" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1125.0" y="775.0" width="433.8" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n457" value="Document Number:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1125.0" y="815.0" width="105.2" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n458" value="FD-NODE-01" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1125.0" y="835.0" width="80.4" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n459" value="Rev:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1510.0" y="815.0" width="30.8" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n460" value="1.0" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1510.0" y="835.0" width="28.3" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n461" value="Sheet:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1710.0" y="815.0" width="43.2" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n462" value="1/1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1710.0" y="835.0" width="28.3" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n463" value="Date: 2026-10-02" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1510.0" y="871.0" width="105.2" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n464" value="Net labels = same net" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1710.0" y="871.0" width="136.2" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>